From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BDK Patches <patches@bdk.invalid>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:41:47 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] bdk: export the BDK engine's service test hook from the
 framework

The engine's services and default presenters have test hooks that the
conformance suite and the engine scenario tests need: what the operating
system's authentication prompt answers, what a default presenter answers
instead of showing native UI, and pages with content of their own served
without the network. They sit behind one function, bdk_testing_control
(//bdk/engine/bdk_testing.h in the BDK repository), so that the export
list needs one name for all of them. Like the other test hooks it is not
the C ABI and gives a page nothing: it acts as the application, on its own
runtime.

List it in chrome/app/framework.exports and in framework.order.

Used by: packages/core/tests/harness_engine.mm and the engine scenario
tests in the BDK repository.
---
 chrome/app/framework.exports | 1 +
 chrome/app/framework.order   | 1 +
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/chrome/app/framework.exports b/chrome/app/framework.exports
index 93a5fc01549ced7a9adb13ba51d3345503a750fc..9d70ef0270ef731c01bb742edcd0d2f7e47d2476 100644
--- a/chrome/app/framework.exports
+++ b/chrome/app/framework.exports
@@ -103,6 +103,7 @@ _OBJC_CLASS_$_BDKApplicationBase
 # BDK: the engine's test hooks (//bdk/engine/bdk_testing.h). Not ABI.
 _bdk_testing_chrome_window_count
 _bdk_testing_click
+_bdk_testing_control
 _bdk_testing_execute_script
 _bdk_testing_forget_profiles
 _bdk_testing_host_context_count
diff --git a/chrome/app/framework.order b/chrome/app/framework.order
index 2f0b6339615bd6615b38881c9aff237d28a28af1..addeba2cbee2c629132d58363c3f72bab789555a 100644
--- a/chrome/app/framework.order
+++ b/chrome/app/framework.order
@@ -111,6 +111,7 @@ _bdk_window_unregister
 # BDK: the engine's test hooks.
 _bdk_testing_chrome_window_count
 _bdk_testing_click
+_bdk_testing_control
 _bdk_testing_execute_script
 _bdk_testing_forget_profiles
 _bdk_testing_host_context_count
